Z||000003||skitime||11-03-2001||10:45 PM||||We will be meeting at the Bob Evans restaurant just east of the intersection<BR>of US30 and I83. If you're coming from the east, go past Harley Davidson,<BR>over the Codorus Creek, and turn right at the next light onto Toronita<BR>Street. You'll see Bob Evans on your right as you approach the light. Turn<BR>into the back of the parking lot from Toronita Street. We usually park in<BR>the back lot.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 11-03-2001).]||||reg||1
